<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">请管理老师按照要求随班级，引导学生顺利通过；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">三、纪律要求及注意事项<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">在步行过程中</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">，各班务必保持两路纵队，女生在前、男生在后。学生</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">必须严守纪律，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">不得相互超越，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">不得追逐打闹，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">不得私自离队，中途不得停留，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">严禁沿途丢扔垃圾。要做到一切行动听指挥，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">严格遵守集合时间。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">自备矿泉水。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">中午全体师生要自备干粮，山里面没有吃饭的地方。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">在景区自由活动时，注意安全。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>6. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">每位学生要穿好校服，选择合适运动鞋。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>7.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">途中师生因身体原因不能坚持行走的，经班主任同意可由随队校车实施救护。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>8.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">整个活动的组织情况由德育处负责评价，评价结果作为大型活动组织奖的考核依据。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>9.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">请假的学生在家休息，请假名单请班主任提前交给年段长。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 127pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 9.07; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">            </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">       </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">德育处<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 127pt; MARGIN: 0cm 28pt 0pt 0cm; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 9.07; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">               </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月 <SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
    
